    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d341">

                <pb facs="0488" n="476" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg476"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 P.W./2–1645: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Personal
                        Representative of President Roosevelt to Pope Pius XII</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Taylor</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-02-21T13:00:00-04:00">February 21,
                            1945—1 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>23. Secret source within Government reports that you have had your “first talk”
                    with Ken Harada. We assume that if such a conversation had occurred you would of
                    course have so reported.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
